      "postID": "653e897a0b083e27cb63f70e",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We have been asking for the setting to be saved since it arrived in its half baked state.\n\nIt’s painful to see the settings menus get so much attention over multiple updates to fix and improve the UI only for this request for near clip to still be ignored. \n\nIf they are super worried about it breaking things, just give us a a launch command or config file command. The users who know what the near clip setting is and want it saved are the ones likely to be comfortable with the extra step until everything else is resolved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6541fabd3690ec52e2a860a5",
      "author": {
        "_id": "6086e40cf54fe42106f55863",
        "alias": "Yellow green Firefly",
        "aliasID": "65c288dbed6eefce4c9b51ee",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/a59d9d18250f6669f0cc52dc582475d7.png",
        "created": "2021-04-26T16:02:20.131Z",
        "name": "frou01",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2023-11-01T07:14:05.227Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "653e897a0b083e27cb63f70e",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f466709e-f226-478f-a598-b8a4ba52aa70\n\nNot crash, but you will have difficulty to acces your menu UI and the shadow should start flashing.\n\nThis is come from floating-point-arithmetic, in a large world, it is a universal thing.\n\nIt used to be a given that world creators had control over this, so they could take precautions in advance.\n\nIt seems that it is not well known that the UI becomes inaccessible. You can't do anything after entering.\n\n(Well, I have an idea for an implementation that doesn't happen like this.However, it would be difficult to add it to the Sagrada Familia Project(VRC) later.)\n\nNowadays, users will complain about not being able to interact with the UI and get frustrated, but under the current circumstances, it is unlikely that someone who rarely visits such a world would complain to the world author without realizing that it come from wrong settings.\n\nThe warning message on changing to \"forced\" is probably for gurding the world author rather than the user. It's standing in between so that users who self-destruct don't complain to the world's creator. The same goes for \"reset\".\n\nAs a result, conflicts between users about this will be less likely to occur. (Note: World creators are also users.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
