      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly, I think it's enough to give all of world creator the option to disable \"dynamic\" or \"forced\" or both. Like avatar scaling.\n\nHowever, VRC probably doesn't want to cause unnecessary trouble to world creators. We are already busy optimizing our world as much as possible to handle the avatar CPU/GPU/VRAM usage.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
