      "value": "@{62def3629e0ae944b12e0c67|full_name}: they want it to reset because they feel it might tread negatively upon the artist's vision for the world. Messing with the near clip plane also messes with the far clip plane to keep the rendering from becoming too messy, but the imposed limits are IMO too low.\n\nThe fact that this option resets is an intentional choice, even though it's a dumb one.",
