      "value": "@{5fd2af43aeaa7e43857595a4|full_name}: The \"artist\" shouldn't and most certainly doesn't care about my preferences and how I configure an app on my PC. Will the artist also cry if I use a colourblind mode?\n\nPeople who override the near clip settings furthermore already have their priorities and opinion on the matter. They are still able to and will change this setting, you are just putting up an annoying extraclick. Default users who don't care about it can stick to the default settings - they are not affected at all.",
