      "value": "@{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name}: I believe this issue is due to the spawn area being too far away from the world origins and this is the responsibility of the world creator to not go outside of the \"safe\" float point precision limits. (Safe limits that vrchat devs could probably implement)\n\nThat said, VRChat could also fix that issue by spawning the menu at coordinate 0 0 0 instead of in front of the player. So no matter where is the player or what settings are used by the player, the menu will always work correctly.",
