      "value": "@{5fd2af43aeaa7e43857595a4|full_name}:   First, I think this is nice workaround.\n\nJust now I noticed a problem. Avatar scaling is often disabled in some worlds, for example in game worlds.\n\nIt seems like it's not a complete solution.\n\nAvatar scaling had a lot of bugs when it was first implemented, so some worlds still have it disabled. (The same goes for my world until recently.)",
